{
  "name": "ListEventDetail",
  "summary": "查询某一事件监控详情",
  "tags": "事件监控",
  "productshort": "CES",
  "region_id": "af-north-1",
  "paths": {
    "/V1.0/{project_id}/event/{event_name}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "事件监控"
        ],
        "summary": "查询某一事件监控详情",
        "description": "根据事件监控名称,查询该事件发生的详细信息。",
        "operationId": "ListEventDetail",
        "x-ces-version": "v1",
        "x-api-type": "open-api",
        "x-php-exclude": "Y",
        "x-code-url": "/V1.0/{project_id}/event-info/{event_name}",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/parameters/ContentType"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/parameters/AuthToken"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/parameters/ProjectId"
          },
          {
            "name": "event_name",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n事件名称,值为系统产生的事件名称或用户自定义上报的事件名称。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n长度为[1,64]个字符。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 64
          },
          {
            "name": "event_type",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n事件类型。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n值为EVENT.SYS或EVENT.CUSTOM。\n- EVENT.SYS:系统事件。\n- EVENT.CUSTOM:自定义事件。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "enum": [
              "EVENT.SYS",
              "EVENT.CUSTOM"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "sub_event_type",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n事件子类。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n枚举类型\n- SUB_EVENT.OPS: 运维事件\n- SUB_EVENT.PLAN: 计划事件\n- SUB_EVENT.CUSTOM: 自定义事件\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "enum": [
              "SUB_EVENT.OPS",
              "SUB_EVENT.PLAN",
              "SUB_EVENT.CUSTOM"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "event_source",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n事件来源,取值为各云服务的命名空间。云服务的命名空间请参考“[支持监控的服务列表](https://support.huaweicloud.com/api-ces/ces_03_0059.html)”。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n长度为[0,32]个字符。\n正则匹配:以字母开头,中间有一个点,包含字母、数字、下划线的字符串。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 0,
            "maxLength": 32
          },
          {
            "name": "event_level",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n事件的级别。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n值为Critical、Major、Minor、Info。\n- Critical: 紧急\n- Major: 重要\n- Minor: 次要\n- Info: 提示\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "Critical",
              "Major",
              "Info",
              "Minor"
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "event_user",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n上报事件监控数据时用户的名称,也可为projectID。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n长度为[0,64]个字符。\n正则匹配:由零个或多个字母、数字、下划线、横线、斜杠、空格、@ 符号或点号组成的字符串。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 0,
            "maxLength": 64
          },
          {
            "name": "event_state",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n事件的状态。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n值为normal、warning、incident。\n- normal: 正常\n- warning: 警告\n- incident: 故障\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "normal",
              "warning",
              "incident"
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "from",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n查询数据起始时间,UNIX时间戳,单位毫秒。例如:1605952700911。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n不涉及。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int64",
            "minimum": 1111111111111,
            "maximum": 9999999999999
          },
          {
            "name": "to",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n查询数据截止时间,UNIX时间戳,单位毫秒。\n**约束限制**:\n其中from必须小于to。\n**取值范围**:\n不涉及。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int64",
            "minimum": 1111111111111,
            "maximum": 9999999999999
          },
          {
            "name": "start",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n分页起始值。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n不涉及。\n**默认取值**:\n0",
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int64",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 9999999999999
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n单次查询的条数限制,用于限制结果数据条数。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n大小为[1,100]的整数\n**默认取值**:\n100",
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 100
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "OK",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ListEventDetailResponseBody"
            },
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "event_name": "rebootServer",
                "event_type": "EVENT.SYS",
                "sub_event_type": "SUB_EVENT.CUSTOM",
                "event_users": [
